sig: fn is_pythagorean(a: int, b: int, c: int) -> [] bool
desc: True when the squares of two of the three numbers add up to the square of the third, in any order. Domain: 1 <= a, b, c <= 100.
example: is_pythagorean(3, 4, 5) == true
example: is_pythagorean(5, 3, 4) == true
example: is_pythagorean(2, 3, 4) == false
